        {
          "id": 588773555,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Are you sure? There is definitely a link at the bottom of commit 7dbd4baa211241d640fe878b8f4a8cd5c2a38eaa so I don't know what the issue is.",
          "author": {
            "id": 2639362,
            "username": "jvalverde",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "João Valverde",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/bea5f745397cf5a2fe0526df96ec143db47f9334340ab56515038832be57e976?s=80&d=identicon",
